<%- include('partials/header') %>
<h1>How it works</h1>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Browse &amp; order at member prices.</strong> Our catalogue and prices are synced automatically from S&amp;R's online store, so you get S&amp;R <em>member</em> prices without paying for a membership.</li>
  <li><strong>Pay.</strong> Settle via GCash or bank transfer using the instructions on your order page (or choose cash on delivery where available).</li>
  <li><strong>We shop.</strong> Once paid, we buy your items at S&amp;R using our membership. If an item is unavailable we'll contact you for a substitute or refund.</li>
  <li><strong>We deliver.</strong> Your order is delivered to your door. Track the status anytime with your order code.</li>
</ol>
<h3>Delivery areas</h3>
<ul><% String(settings.delivery_areas || '').split('\n').filter(s => s.trim()).forEach(a => { %><li><%= a %></li><% }) %></ul>
<p>Delivery fee: <%= formatPeso(settings.delivery_fee) %><% if (Number(settings.free_delivery_over) > 0) { %>, free on orders over <%= formatPeso(settings.free_delivery_over) %><% } %>.</p>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
